    <title>vol.110 不上班时去变美：成熟女性的彩妆小课堂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af3fdb03caef3b52f540c5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af3fdb03caef3b52f540c5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:47:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>无广告、全干货！美丽达人孟孟做客，和大家分享那些顺手好用的彩妆工具，以及一看就会的化妆小技巧。不同场景出门怎么快速上妆、补妆？怎样用对工具少走弯路？孟孟都一一分享，也帮我们解开了不少化妆小困惑。谁说中女就要放弃自己？取悦自己才最重要。想化得顺手、出门从容，这期别错过。</span></p><p><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾//孟孟</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">00:02:23</a>:从学生时代的夸张彩妆到现在的裸妆潮流。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">00:06:15</a>:冷白皮？黄一皮？橄榄皮？你的皮肤什么颜色？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">00:07:17</a>:素颜霜、BB霜、隔离霜？这些底妆有什么区别啊？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">00:10:40</a>:睫毛膏怎么选？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">00:11:48</a>:如何选择适合自己的口红颜色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">00:13:35</a>:卡粉、不上妆、斑驳？干燥冬季如何保持底妆服帖？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">00:16:16</a>:关于重要的防晒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">00:19:38</a>:大胆到专柜试妆选择适合自己的妆容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">00:21:57</a>:简妆包括哪些步骤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">00:23:10</a>:种睫毛的弊端</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">00:24:09</a>:半永久的懒人利器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">00:25:37</a>:眉笔、眉粉怎么选？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">00:27:05</a>:彩妆新手的无效化妆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">00:30:34</a>:如何提升面部平整度？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">00:31:15</a>:去专柜试个全妆？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">00:36:16</a>:借助工具上底妆的小技巧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">00:38:34</a>:通勤和出去玩妆容区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">00:40:44</a>:利用AI工具选择适合的妆容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">00:42:25</a>:从内而外的美丽女人：取悦自己</span></p><p><str