    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae051abc96c8942ec12f4ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>装修好像升级打怪：全屋智能、电器选择、半包全包怎么选、装修公司怎么挑、预算怎么控……学问大着呢！本期邀请刚为家里做完全屋智能装修的竹子，聊聊从前期做功课到落地避坑的真实经验，哪些能省、哪些不能省，怎样兼顾老人孩子做成长型装修，分享从做功课到避坑的真实经验，快来听听吧！</span></p><p><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾//竹子</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:00:48</a>:全屋智能家居之全方位智能控制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">00:05:01</a>:智能家居电器的选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">00:07:21</a>:漫长而充实的装修前期工作回顾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">00:09:27</a>:全包、半包、轻包怎么选？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">00:10:51</a>:装修预算的控制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a>:如何选择装修公司</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">00:15:04</a>:装修设计主要还得靠自己！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">00:17:40</a>:家具要不要全屋定制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">00:20:05</a>:装修的简洁留白理念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">00:22:08</a>:关于储物空间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">00:25:48</a>:如何避免电子类产品带来的质量问题？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">00:27:29</a>:智能马桶的耐用性与故障率</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">00:31:31</a>:除甲醛的万种方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">00:34:21</a>:哪些可以省，哪些千万不能省！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">00:36:06</a>:可持续成长型装修：满足孩子和老人现在和未来的需求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">00:40:15</a>:成长型装修设计：电器插座与家具选择的平衡之道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">00:42:57</a>:太值了！让人幸福感拉满的装修设计。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">00:45:53</a>:重新装修你会有不一样的选择吗</span></p><p><strong><span>【音频后期】思念的思</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【收听方式】小宇宙 喜马拉雅 苹果播客 网易云音乐 荔