    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 05:15:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>河流曙光音乐节的露营区发现一位弹吉他的帅哥，我去网上把他捞来录播客了！本期我们和音乐节老炮一起，从音乐节初印象到露营区深夜，从乐队现场到给新人的真心建议，夸了也吐槽了，笑了也感动了。音乐节露营到底有多上头？快来听听吧！</span></p><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾//HAKU</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">00:01:11</a>:河流曙光音乐节那个弹唱俱佳的小哥哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">00:03:11</a>:众多音乐节之间分类和差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">00:04:45</a>:活人味儿十足的快乐音乐节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">00:07:01</a>:震撼所有乐迷的L-ISA音响设备</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">00:09:50</a>:硬给完美的河流音乐节找点提升空间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">00:12:38</a>:音乐节为什么禁酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">00:16:11</a>:跨省交通小窍门</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">00:17:59</a>:音乐节露营怎么玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">00:20:22</a>:音乐节摔跤文化的由来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a>:第一次沉浸式体验音乐节露营</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">00:26:31</a>:露营的不便不处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">00:27:53</a>:你的必备物资</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">00:31:08</a>:物料周边交换分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">00:36:22</a>:神仙阵容之后朋克</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a>:Reggae music雷鬼的起源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">00:39:40</a>:聊聊我们喜欢的音乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">00:42:16</a>:“他们还没唱的时候我就会唱了”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">00:45:35</a>:不吹不黑：聊聊那些没打动我的乐队</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">00:47:57</a>:严禁“冷焰火”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3109">00