    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>教师节聊老师，主打一个“爱恨交织”。本期我们和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69874879667153da35e95739" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69874879667153da35e95739"><span>《稳当住了HoldOn》</span></a><span>串台攒了个“吐槽局”，从收礼偏心的“人情世故”，到体罚PUA的“童年阴影”，怨气不小，笑料也不少。但吐槽归吐槽，我们也认真分享了那些真正点亮过人生的好老师——他们如何接住你的窘迫，帮你找回自信，甚至悄悄改变你的人生轨迹。听完你会发现，好老师是光，坏老师是坑，而我们都在这光与坑的交错里，长成了现在的大人。你的学生时代，又遇到过哪位让你“意难平”的老师呢？</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾//大号</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69874879667153da35e95739" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69874879667153da35e95739"><strong><span>（稳当住了HoldOn）</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">00:01:28</a>:学生喜欢什么样的老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:体罚学生？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">00:05:31</a>:挑剔又自以为是的PUA型老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">00:12:41</a>:送礼那点事儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">00:18:57</a>:你敢投诉吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">00:23:22</a>:家长在孩子教育中的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">00:28:20</a>:无私加班的好老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">00:32:41</a>:语文和英语老师的刻板印象！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">00:34:51</a>:假如我是一名教师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">00:36:12</a>:残疾政治老师的魅力：学生眼中的好老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">00:38:29</a>:不同老师对待课堂没收闲书的处理方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">00:40:16</a>:泪流满面集体送离的历史老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">00:42:46</a>:学生心目中好老师的标准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">00:46:09</a>:印象深刻的老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">00:51:33</a>:教师节祝福：感谢师者匠人，共创美好未来！</span></p><p><strong><span>【音频后期】思念的思</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【收听方式】小宇宙 喜马拉雅 苹果播客 网易云音乐 荔枝播客 蜻蜓FM豆瓣播客 QQ音乐 虎扑博客</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【公众号】不上班时做什么</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXzN53e1_RhXEfdUHLbTCRcLdTP.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
