    <title>vol.98 不上班时去约会：七夕约会项目全攻略</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a83ceaf5aeb2a5712e877a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a83ceaf5aeb2a5712e877a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>七夕从古人的星辰神话，慢慢变成了牛郎织女的爱情传说。古代这天要穿针乞巧、看蜘蛛结网、吃巧果，如今则成了中国情人节。本期我们来聊约会——吃饭点菜能看出性格，第一次见面别急着看电影。户外玩水露营？夏天热到妆花。夏天约会怎么安排才不踩坑？欢迎来听，也欢迎评论区分享你的约会经历。</span></p><p><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:00:19</a>:七夕无关的小故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a>:浪漫七夕的爱情故事与传统习俗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">00:03:23</a>:传统乞巧节做手工</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">00:04:36</a>:七夕节演化成为向往爱情的情人节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">00:06:56</a>:初期情侣约会做些什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">00:07:45</a>:从吃饭看人品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">00:11:19</a>:借助小工具敲定的约会项目——溯溪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">00:15:09</a>:春天露营踏青，带上好朋友一起玩！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">00:17:05</a>:电影院观影礼仪：该不该呵斥影响电影观影的的行为？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">00:21:41</a>:咖啡书店约会聊天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">00:23:12</a>:剧本杀、桌游、密室逃脱等等约会项目，哪个更适合你？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">00:24:00</a>:看脱口秀、音乐节…那些需要志趣相投的约会项目</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">00:28:18</a>:约会逛商场：逛逛宜家、无印良品、玩具店甚至室内游乐场！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">00:31:35</a>:约会泡温泉游泳会尴尬吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">00:34:10</a>:即使不说话也不会觉得尴尬。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">00:37:45</a>:逛动物园！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">00:38:38</a>:人生高光时刻表达爱意的小巧思</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">00:43:00</a>:有情人终成眷属</span></p><p><strong><span>【音频后期】思念的思</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【收听方式】小宇宙 喜马拉雅 苹果播客 网易云音乐 荔枝播客 蜻蜓FM豆瓣播客 QQ音乐 虎扑博客</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【公众号】不上班时做什么</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXzN53e1_RhXEfdUHLbTCRcLdTP.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
