    <title>vol.97 不上班时去旅行：魔幻土耳其——我的超详细旅行计划及避坑指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7ac4ad36641f136d8673fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7ac4ad36641f136d8673fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑期过半，主播思思一家出发了——土耳其我们来了！坐了梦幻的热气球，踩过棉花堡，开过最美沿海公路。但也经历了这里的交通像开盲盒，顿顿吃烤肉吃到腻，我们还参观了小说中才有的奢华酒店，居然还被枪指着头…出发前的各种焦虑，行程中的避雷和小贴士，有风景也有狼狈，欢迎来听！</span></p><p><strong><span>主播//思念的思 王二毛毛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>playlist：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:00:45</a>:制定出行计划，告别出行焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">00:04:25</a>:确定全部旅行目的地，小交通如何搞定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">00:07:24</a>:淳朴的土耳其包车司机和繁忙的小镇交通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">00:10:51</a>:聊聊土耳其长途巴士：购票方式、车辆类型和时间准确性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">00:17:54</a>:D400公路——土耳其沿海最美公路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">00:20:15</a>:变化无常的汇率和行前</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">00:21:14</a>:行前准备：电话卡、流量卡、公交卡和出租车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">00:22:57</a>:伊斯坦布尔交通：地铁、出租车、轮渡和铛铛车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">00:28:48</a>: 宗教氛围浓厚的伊斯坦布尔风情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">00:32:07</a>:传说中的土耳其美食：顿顿吃肉是什么体验！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">00:36:20</a>:住宿推荐：景点附近最方便！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">00:37:11</a>:体验全靠运气的土耳其热气球和滑翔伞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">00:41:00</a>:打卡土耳其棉花堡小贴士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">00:47:46</a>:畅享土耳其烤肉与当地特色菜肴！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">00:47:06</a>:体验格雷梅红线一日游</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2984">00:49:44</a>:土耳其变化多端的天气和体验刺激的热气球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">00:54:15</a>:与不会英语的当地人交流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">00:57:15</a>:严格的各种安检</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3521">00:58:41</a>:体验文学作品中的奢华酒店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">01:03:02</a>:“我在中央大街被枪指着头”&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3985">01:06:25</a>:行李打包小贴士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">01:08:00</a>:土耳其行注意事项：天气、住宿、交通和保险！</span></p><p><strong><span>【音频后期】思念的思</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【收听方式】小宇宙 喜马拉雅 苹果播客 网易云音乐 荔枝播客 蜻蜓FM豆瓣播客 QQ音乐 虎扑博客</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【公众号】不上班时做什么</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXzN53e1_RhXEfdUHLbTCRcLdTP.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
